      "text": "1. inOrderTraversal: if exceptions are found, return false\ninOrderTraversal: traverse the binary tree in a way such that the predecessor < successor.\n\n2. subtreeProperty: if exceptions are found, return false\nnode.left < node and node.right > node, for each node.\n",
